. Joey has a big question for Lorena and Ashley gets friendzoned.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/68zEk29l3fpGIyCENDrNEBamOqu.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-04\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":4,\"name\":\"May The Best Man Win\",\"overview\":\"Joey and Lorena are official but someone threatens their happiness. David gets cold feet with Laytesha. Ashley has some luck and Michael and Victoria get closer.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yLWE35LhuRSSsrTc7cGbpyOH8S2.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-11\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":5,\"name\":\"Head To Head\",\"overview\":\"Itay finally realises he's lost the battle for Lorena. Ashley get's pied by Georgia. Ellie gets an apology she's been longing for and the Tablet Of Terror dishes up double trouble.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/yjstlY3SD79BNVVYGelcGF84RB0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-18\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":6,\"name\":\"There’s A New Celeb In Toon!\",\"overview\":\"Watch out lads! There’s a Geordie on the shore... Georgia realizes she made a mistake and Itay and Victoria's time together is coming to a end.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/acd3Bj3u2URnZgacvIE5Lxj8S3D.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-02-25\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":7,\"name\":\"The Queen Has Arrived\",\"overview\":\"Lateysha and David hit the rocks when reality queen Tiffany Pollard arrives, causing drama by exposing David's true feelings towards Lateysha; two exes leave the villa for good.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/wyxGxOF59AbptrZrG9m63WlBzak.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-03\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":8,\"name\":\"Battle Of The Divas\",\"overview\":\"Emotions run high as Victoria is torn between Michael and a new arrival. Lateysha explodes when Marissa flirts with David, and Joey performs a romantic rap for Lorena.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pNCg91Dq9LeKrff0bwChovjNWnk.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-10\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":9,\"name\":\"Heartbreak\",\"overview\":\"The most dramatic and emotional arrival to ever hit the beach causes heartache for Lorena, but will it be the end of JOLO? Michael confides in Ellie but will he move on from Victoria?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/q9e8OYWX0C0RFjx8yxwTy67O9ln.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-17\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":10,\"name\":\"Double Trouble\",\"overview\":\"Joey’s insecurities get the better of him when Lorena wants to make sweet music with Patrick. David finally apologises to Lateysha and there’s a shock double EX arrival down at the beach.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/2VhjU2f8BIhUp9JTwLczxY4ycw0.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-24\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":11,\"name\":\"Calum's Choice\",\"overview\":\"The TOT makes Calum send one of his exes home, Georgia gets emotional with Ashley, Michael and Ellie become closer 'friends' and there's a surprise celebrity on the horizon\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/dFjj6IGr6XSPFfllQwYxgbPzjod.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-03-30\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":12,\"name\":\"Miles and the Mob Wife\",\"overview\":\"Miles, the new celebrity, makes quite an impression on Marissa. David gets a double dressing down and the girls have a tough decision to make.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/rTHkVoxVMNpjmz2Uic7RfSPyDO1.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-07\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":13,\"name\":\"As One Door Closes Another One Opens\",\"overview\":\"One of the boys get sent home leaving the girls in tears. It all gets too much for one of the original eight. Sophie may have finally met the man of her dreams.\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/50evaFnZFz2sQrusGJHVUvnRB0w.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-14\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":14,\"name\":\"The Mob Wife Goes In\",\"overview\":\"Georgia and Miles get closer but will it all end in tears? Marissa is pushed to her 'mob wife' limits, and Joey and Lorena head down to the beach for the final arrival!\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/pEuBogHYHEITBvIiU1Hud671g0V.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-21\",\"runtime\":45},{\"number\":15,\"name\":\"The Finale\",\"overview\":\"Joey gets the shock of his life. An ex makes a spectacular return for the grand finale. Georgia gets emotional but will she get her happy ending along with all the other couples?\",\"still\":\"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/6BIRNE5mBpIYZq6Q3efjSEhpSMa.jpg\",\"rating\":0,\"voteCount\":0,\"airDate\":\"2020-04-28\",\"runtime\":45}],\"firstAirDate\":\"2020-01-21\"}","status":200,"url":""},"revalidate":86400,"tags":[]}